{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2014-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1406851200, "end_date": 1407455999, "month_true_total": 131, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:57:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "11592350", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992641158", "personaname": "skurpi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/skurpi/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 304, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 304, "last_played": 1370549799, "avatar": "1ae31177a564daedbca444daf02e57362b66544c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Sweet multiplayer game! Find three friends and go for it. Very strategic, very tactical. When you increase the difficulty, it also involves a lot of skill", "timestamp_created": 1407441857, "timestamp_updated": 1407441857, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11588406", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059543076", "personaname": "GreyZero", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/112406254411/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 601, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 556, "last_played": 1410701360, "avatar": "263b111518c4d2eda1c07d68407977951c2d240f"}, "language": "english", "review": "good playing and thanks", "timestamp_created": 1407420790, "timestamp_updated": 1407420790, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11586733", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033920592", "personaname": "Vamatti™", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198033920592/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 887, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 469, "last_played": 1435645051, "avatar": "105ff5b28365b4948ecf019519d7522069f39604"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its dangerous to go alone....\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOne of the best co-op games i have ever played.\n\nAliens, space marines, welding doors and leaving teammates to their doom. Everything i love in a top-down shooter.\n\nThis game is completely free and i would love to see Valve continue work on this or make a sequel and stop at Alien swarm 2. \n\nThings i would love to see if Valve continues Alien swarm series: Endless survival, 4 VS 4 squad battles, 4 VS 4 survival, more campaigns, Marines VS Alien Swarm leader and lastly most of all 4 V 4 or more base CTF with turrets, slowly replenishing ammo and an ever present alien threat between the two bases.\n\n\nThe only bad thing i have to say about this game is that finding games in Australia is near impossible.\n\n9/10 for co-op\n7/10 for controls\n3/10 for finding games\n5/10 for Alien variety\n8/10 for how dangerous it is to go alone\n\n64/100 total score", "timestamp_created": 1407410724, "timestamp_updated": 1407410724, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11583309", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095332473", "personaname": "Anilom", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198095332473/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 195, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 100, "last_played": 1477839609, "avatar": "fe619a9411da16f82237dfd05916ce2d847c0d34"}, "language": "english", "review": "This Game is just awesome! Really worth the time and the Gig. Eventhough I played it for a little while, I just think the idea and the gameplay perfectly compliment each other.", "timestamp_created": 1407383473, "timestamp_updated": 1407383473, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "11581654", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035559878", "personaname": "Dab Junior", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198035559878/", "num_games_owned": 170, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 1278, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1035, "last_played": 1728621469, "avatar": "235e6e10cd66af9a6c42020f8053cf3a32508522"}, "language": "english", "review": "Aliens+Guns+Friends= Fun :)", "timestamp_created": 1407369916, "timestamp_updated": 1407369916, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}